# OCCTBIM Linux AppImage

This is a placeholder for the Linux AppImage package.

File: OCCTBIM-Linux-v1.3.0.AppImage
Size: ~180MB
Platform: Linux x64 (Ubuntu 18.04+, CentOS 7+)

To build the actual AppImage, you would need:
- linuxdeploy tool
- Compiled OCCTBIM binaries
- Dependencies (Qt, OpenCASCADE, etc.)
- AppImage build scripts

Contact: contact@occtbim.com for source code and build instructions.